          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will Titanium Jewellery Fade In Color?",
            "answer": "<p>Titanium naturally maintains its brilliant metallic finish and will never tarnish or turn black like cheaper alloys or silver. It requires zero polishing to keep its underlying shine, ensuring it looks beautiful for years.</p>"
          }
        },
